# Per-run evidence directories. Live smoke runs write these next to the
# project; keeping them out of git stops `git status` drowning in throwaway
# snapshots. data-market-run/ is deliberately not listed: it is the one
# directory holding a full multi-book capture kept for comparison.
data-smoke*/
data-verify*/

# Scratch space for live probes, ad-hoc scrapers and debug scripts. Everything
# in here is disposable by construction and is regenerated on demand.
scratch/

# Output of `npm run smoke:live`: a per-book health snapshot written on every
# run. It is a measurement, not a source file.
data-health.json
data/measurements.jsonl

# Images produced by tooling rather than authored for the repo.
generated-images/

# Windows reserves `nul`; a stray redirect can create a real file with that
# name, which is untracked and unreadable by tooling.
nul

.DS_Store
*.log
.vscode/
.idea/
